  <description>
    Primitive Gazebo model of the lab experimental polygon from the measured
    pipe drawing.  The left vertical pipe has 457.2 mm radius, the right
    vertical pipe has 254 mm radius, and the single horizontal pipe has
    254 mm radius and 2420 mm length.
  </description>
</model>
